		(property "Footprint Note" "No Littelfuse RHEF footprint exists in the KiCad libraries. F1 uses the Bourns MF-RG300 land pattern: pads at (0,0) and (5.1,1.2), 5.24 mm centre-to-centre, 1.01 mm drills. RHEF200 leads are 0.51 mm dia at 5.05 +/-0.75 mm spacing, so they fit, but the Bourns part is a 3.0 A/5.1 A device and the drawn body outline is its, not the RHEF200's - do not trust the outline for clearance."
