		(property "BOM Comments" "Replaces GCT USB4970-00-A, which LCSC does not stock - an MPN search will always come up empty. The USB4125 is a different GCT line number that LCSC does carry, and the board was already laid out to its land pattern. Stock is thin (~600-3,700 depending on source) next to the generic Chinese 6P parts, so order spares. Plain 1.00 mm stake variant is C3151650 if the -0190 is out."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(layer "F.Fab")
			(hide yes)
			(uuid "3f206328-99d5-4031-9015-0e34a06015ba")
