		(property "Spec" "PNP TO-92, pin order E-C-B (collector in the middle) - datasheet ordering table, not a drawing. Rank P = hFE 200-400, matching the ~46 uA base current measured at ~9.3 mA emitter. VCEO -50 V, IC -150 mA, VEBO -5 V (same as the 2SA1015 it replaces, so R2 still guards the B-E junction), fT 190 MHz typ, Cob 2-3 pF. Schematic reuses the Transistor_BJT:2SA1015 symbol - same pinout family."
